    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/1d88cc575a5e63c2558d409a214822bf.avif?t=1744637019\" width=650 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the backdrop of <i>AOA Academy</i>, this side story takes you on an emotional journey as the protagonist and Rebecca explore the complexities of love, personal growth, and relationships. After a life-changing year, the protagonist finds themselves in a new chapter, and alongside Rebecca, they embark on a journey that challenges everything they thought they knew about connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they navigate their evolving relationship, they face moments of joy, doubt, and reflection, building toward the ultimate step: marriage. This intimate story dives into Rebecca's character and provides a deeper look at her emotions, growth, and the meaningful bond that develops between the two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the main game focuses on the protagonist's new life at A.O.A Academy, <i>AOA Academy: Christmas\u00a0</i>takes a step back to focus on the heart, offering fans a chance to see the emotional depth of the protagonist\u2019s connection with Rebecca. This heartfelt side story serves as a beautiful companion, exploring the complexities of love and commitment, and answering the question of what happens after all the trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/33477708ca1dd973f83db2605e4c1260.poster.avif?t=1744637019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/33477708ca1dd973f83db2605e4c1260.webm?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/33477708ca1dd973f83db2605e4c1260.mp4?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Christmas Edition Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Holiday Twist on the Story</strong>: New events, festive decorations, and seasonal surprises, adding a special charm to the game\u2019s rich narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Romance Path</strong>: New opportunities to explore deeper connections with your dream girl, with special Christmas events that bring your love story to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Christmas Edition</strong>, now with added holiday content, where romance, mystery, and intrigue continue to unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Holiday Outfits</strong>: Admire your favorite characters in new, festive outfits. Whether it's a cozy sweater, a Santa costume, or a chic winter outfit, the characters\u2019 holiday attire adds to the charm and excitement of the season.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/4dc5a30c7d0d7872bbd8e00eedd01415.poster.avif?t=1744637019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/4dc5a30c7d0d7872bbd8e00eedd01415.webm?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/4dc5a30c7d0d7872bbd8e00eedd01415.mp4?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Beginning in the Season of Miracles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This holiday season, the academy opens its doors wider than ever, and your place in the story has never been clearer. But beneath the glittering decorations, the academy is not as peaceful as it seems. Danger lurks in the shadows, and your relationships will be tested as the snow falls. Can you balance the magic of Christmas with the mysteries surrounding A.O.A Academy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out in this festive edition of A.O.A Academy \u2013 where love, mystery, and the holiday spirit await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/86bed51d9b0aa6b2e51343d714c6734d.poster.avif?t=1744637019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/86bed51d9b0aa6b2e51343d714c6734d.webm?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/86bed51d9b0aa6b2e51343d714c6734d.mp4?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/1d88cc575a5e63c2558d409a214822bf.avif?t=1744637019\" width=650 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set against the backdrop of <i>AOA Academy</i>, this side story takes you on an emotional journey as the protagonist and Rebecca explore the complexities of love, personal growth, and relationships. After a life-changing year, the protagonist finds themselves in a new chapter, and alongside Rebecca, they embark on a journey that challenges everything they thought they knew about connection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As they navigate their evolving relationship, they face moments of joy, doubt, and reflection, building toward the ultimate step: marriage. This intimate story dives into Rebecca's character and provides a deeper look at her emotions, growth, and the meaningful bond that develops between the two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the main game focuses on the protagonist's new life at A.O.A Academy, <i>AOA Academy: Christmas\u00a0</i>takes a step back to focus on the heart, offering fans a chance to see the emotional depth of the protagonist\u2019s connection with Rebecca. This heartfelt side story serves as a beautiful companion, exploring the complexities of love and commitment, and answering the question of what happens after all the trials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/33477708ca1dd973f83db2605e4c1260.poster.avif?t=1744637019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/33477708ca1dd973f83db2605e4c1260.webm?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/33477708ca1dd973f83db2605e4c1260.mp4?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Christmas Edition Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Holiday Twist on the Story</strong>: New events, festive decorations, and seasonal surprises, adding a special charm to the game\u2019s rich narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A New Romance Path</strong>: New opportunities to explore deeper connections with your dream girl, with special Christmas events that bring your love story to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Christmas Edition</strong>, now with added holiday content, where romance, mystery, and intrigue continue to unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Holiday Outfits</strong>: Admire your favorite characters in new, festive outfits. Whether it's a cozy sweater, a Santa costume, or a chic winter outfit, the characters\u2019 holiday attire adds to the charm and excitement of the season.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/4dc5a30c7d0d7872bbd8e00eedd01415.poster.avif?t=1744637019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/4dc5a30c7d0d7872bbd8e00eedd01415.webm?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/4dc5a30c7d0d7872bbd8e00eedd01415.mp4?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A New Beginning in the Season of Miracles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This holiday season, the academy opens its doors wider than ever, and your place in the story has never been clearer. But beneath the glittering decorations, the academy is not as peaceful as it seems. Danger lurks in the shadows, and your relationships will be tested as the snow falls. Can you balance the magic of Christmas with the mysteries surrounding A.O.A Academy?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out in this festive edition of A.O.A Academy \u2013 where love, mystery, and the holiday spirit await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/86bed51d9b0aa6b2e51343d714c6734d.poster.avif?t=1744637019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/86bed51d9b0aa6b2e51343d714c6734d.webm?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501760/extras/86bed51d9b0aa6b2e51343d714c6734d.mp4?t=1744637019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
